    aunty, Dubai wale rishtay pe to visa bhi free mil jata hai! Ap done krein meri
    taraf se \",\"parentUIDs\":[12],\"SpeechUID\":-1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":16}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":675.9997,\"yPos\":102.333313},\"ID\":14,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Nai
    aunty, mujhe abhi abhi degree complete krni hai.\",\"parentUIDs\":[12],\"SpeechUID\":-1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":23}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":56.666626,\"yPos\":213.000031},\"ID\":21,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Haan
    aunty, ghar hi mera career hai. Promotion bhi wahi mile gi jab saas ko khush
    kar lungi!\",\"parentUIDs\":[20],\"SpeechUID\":-1},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":24}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":384.000122,\"yPos\":207.000092},\"ID\":22,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Nai
    aunty, job bhi karni hai\u2026 warna degree diwaar pe saja ke kya faida? Main
    to corporate baddie hoon, deadlines aur coffee dono manage karti hoon!\",\"parentUIDs\":[20],\"SpeechUID\":-1}],\"Parameters\":[],\"SpeechNodes\":[{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":4}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":true,\"xPos\":-4.333374,\"yPos\":-207.333344},\"ID\":0,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Assalam-o-alaikum
    beta, kaisi ho? MashAllah bari pyari lag rahi ho \",\"parentUIDs\":[],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Rishta
    Aunty \",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":8},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":9}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":673.9997,\"yPos\":-204.666687},\"ID\":7,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Dekho
    beta, larkiyon ki umar ka pata hi nahi chalta\u2026 is liye seedha poochti hoon
    shaadi hogai hai ya abhi tak ghar walay chup hain? Mere paas ek bara acha rishta
    hai, larka doctor hai. Khehti hou tou baat krun?\",\"parentUIDs\":[18],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Rishta
    Aunty\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":20}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":685.9996,\"yPos\":-1.333313},\"ID\":10,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Wah
    beta, tum to bari samajhdar nikli. Doctor hai, clinic apna hai, maa-baap ki akeli
    aulaad hai. Tumhari mama ko kal hi phone karti hoon! \",\"parentUIDs\":[9],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Rishta
    Aunty\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":12}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":446.000183,\"yPos\":-5.33334351},\"ID\":11,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Haye
    Allah beta, tum to bari chalak nikli! Lekin sun lo, har banda thoda BP barhata
    hai\u2026 doctor ka to faida ye hai ke woh saath hi dawa bhi likh dega. Samjho
    full package hai! \",\"parentUIDs\":[8],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Rishta
    Aunty\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":13},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":14}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":433.333557,\"yPos\":109.333313},\"ID\":12,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Khair,
    doctor pasand nai to koi baat nai\u2026 mere paas ek aur rishta hai. Larka Dubai
    mein job karta hai, visa aur car dono ready. Kya kehti ho?\",\"parentUIDs\":[11],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Rishta
    Aunty\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":20}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":200.666626,\"yPos\":-1.99987793},\"ID\":15,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Bas
    beta, tumne dil jeet liya. Kal passport tayar rakho, shaadi ka ticket confirm
    samjho!\",\"parentUIDs\":[13],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Rishta
    Aunty\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":667.9997,\"yPos\":183.333374},\"ID\":16,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Haye
    Allah beta, parh likh ke kya karna hai? Aakhir mein to roti hi banani hai na.
    Shaadi kar lo, degree baad mein bhi latakti rahe gi.\",\"parentUIDs\":[14],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Rishta
    Aunty\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableSpeechConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":7}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":444.6668,\"yPos\":-203.333374},\"ID\":18,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Bas
    Allah ka shukar hai\",\"parentUIDs\":[4],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Rishta
    Aunty\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":21},{\"__type\":\"EditableOptionConnection:#DialogueEditor\",\"Conditions\":[],\"NodeUID\":22}],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":68,\"yPos\":94.66669},\"ID\":20,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Lekin
    ek baat aur batao\u2026 shaadi ke baad job karni hai ya ghar sambhalna hai?\",\"parentUIDs\":[10,15],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Rishta
    Aunty\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":89.33333,\"yPos\":318.000031},\"ID\":23,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"SubhanAllah
    beta! Tumhari soch ne to mera dil jeet liya. Aisi hi larkiyan ghar basati hain,
    aur susraal mein CEO ban jaati hain. Chalo, aunty ne tumhe top position ke liye
    shortlist kar diya! Tumhari ammi se jakar baat karti hun.\",\"parentUIDs\":[21],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Rishta
    Aunty\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0},{\"Connections\":[],\"EditorInfo\":{\"isRoot\":false,\"xPos\":457.333557,\"yPos\":313.3334},\"ID\":24,\"ParamActions\":[],\"TMPFontGUID\":null,\"Text\":\"Corporate
    baddie? Haye Allah beta\u2026 shaadi ke baad tum sirf laundry baddie banogi.
    Degree aur deadlines sab bhool jao, asal project sirf ek hoga: roti banani aur
    ghar chalana. Aur sun lo, ismein koi extension nahi milti. Baki tumhari marzi.\",\"parentUIDs\":[22],\"AdvanceDialogueAutomatically\":false,\"AudioGUID\":null,\"AutoAdvanceShouldDisplayOption\":false,\"IconGUID\":null,\"Name\":\"Rishta
    Aunty\",\"OptionUIDs\":null,\"SpeechUID\":0,\"TimeUntilAdvance\":0,\"Volume\":0}]}"
